  "ingredients": [
    "24 ounce ground beef (80/20)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "2 cup spinach",
    "1/2 cup mozzarella cheese (shredded)",
    "2 tablespoon grated parmesan cheese",
    "12 ounce cauliflower (riced)",
    "4 tablespoon butter (divided)",
    "2 tablespoon sour cream",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients. Wash the spinach and cauliflower, if needed. Pat dry with a paper towel.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the ground beef chuck to a bowl and season with salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Create patties with your hands that are about 1/2\" thick.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a saucepan over medium heat, put the spinach in and cook for 2 minutes until the spinach gets wilty.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain the spinach and pat it with a paper towel to remove as much water as possible. Chop the spinach up into tiny pieces.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer spinach to a bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the mozzarella cheese and grated parmesan cheese to the bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top half of the patties with the spinach, mozzarella, and parmesan cheese mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover the patties with the other half.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Seal the edges of the two patties together and press down firmly to flatten the patties.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a pan over medium heat, grill the burgers for about 6 minutes on each side.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the burgers are cooking, prepare the cauliflower rice by combining the riced cauliflower and half of the butter in a saucepan and cook over medium heat for 6 - 9 minutes. Stir well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once cooked, add the rest of the butter and sour cream. Stir to combine well. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Spinach-Mozzarella-Stuffed-Burgers-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the burgers with the cauliflower rice and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-spinach-mozzarella-stuffed-burgers/#wprm-recipe-53989-step-0-13",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
